  "explanation": "The question asks for the region of Forum Iulii. Two distinct historical references exist:\n\n1. **D1S1** identifies Cividale del Friuli as part of the **Friuli-Venezia Giulia** region and notes it is also known as *Forum Iulii*.\n2. **D4S1** identifies Voghera as *Forum Iulii Iriensium* and places it in the **Lombardy** region.\n\nBoth documents independently associate different towns with the Latin name *Forum Iulii*, indicating two distinct historical uses of the same name. Since the question does not specify a disambiguation criterion (e.g., modern location, ancient name), both answers are valid and complementary."
